  "body": "**Link to problem area**: https://spec.matrix.org/v1.7/server-server-api/#resolving-server-names\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\nSRV records are best described at https://www.cloudflare.com/learning/dns/dns-records/dns-srv-record/\r\n\r\nConsidering an SRV record is supposed to always have a port, does it make sense to default to port 8448? The equivalent step under .well-known (Step 3.3) makes no mention of a default port.\r\n\r\nWe should unpick this and decide if there's a default port or not, then apply it to both steps.\r\n",
